om, Anna and Mr. Long. \"Surprise!\" they shout. Mai is very surprised and happy. Nam is funny and dances on a chair. Mrs. Rosa brings a big cake. \"Thank you for inviting me to my own party!\" Mai laughs.","question":"Who dances on a chair?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"Nam\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c3","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Bữa tiệc bất ngờ\".","id":"u15n4l2-e02","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Who dances on a chair?"},"skillIds":["reading","u15.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"nhút"},{"id":"t2","text":"không"},{"id":"t3","text":"chơi"},{"id":"t4","text":"ta"},{"id":"t5","text":"nhát"},{"id":"t6","text":"bạn"},{"id":"t7","text":"Em"},{"id":"t8","text":"mi"},{"id":"t9","text":"trai"},{"id":"t10","text":"có"},{"id":"t11","text":"Nha"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"Em trai bạn có nhút nhát không?\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t7","t9","t6","t10","t1","t5","t2"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"brother\" = anh trai; \"shy\" = nhút nhát","id":"u15n4l2-e03","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Dịch sang tiếng Việt: \"Is your brother shy?\""},"skillIds":["u15.grammar"],"type":"wordBank","vocabularyIds":["u2.brother","u15.shy"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":12,"referenceText":"He is tall and funny."},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"He is tall and funny.\". Cũng đúng: \"He's tall and funny.\".","gradingRule":{"acceptedText":["He is tall and funny.","He's tall and funny."],"caseSensitive":false,"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":true},"hint":"Gợi ý trả lời: \"Anh ấy cao và vui tính.\"","id":"u15n4l2-e04","nonSpeechAlternative":{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"I like old movies."},{"id":"c2","text":"I eat bread and eggs."},{"id":"c3","text":"He is tall and funny."}]},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"He is tall and funny.\".","gradingRu